Since Markdown is only the intermediate output, you can leave the
equation rendering to Pandoc. For Pandoc, you can define your own
template when converting .md to .tex in which you can
\usepackage{mathtools}; see
http://johnmacfarlane.net/pandoc/README.html (search for "--template"
in the manual)

